{"ex-E301-1":{"id":"ex-E301-1","chapter":"E301","number":1,"title":"電水煲的最終能源效益","question":"<p>一個 2200 W 的電水煲加熱 1.5 kg 的水，水的初温度為 25 °C。水在4 分鐘後煮沸。</p><p>(a) 求輸入電水煲的能量。</p><p>(b) 求電水煲輸出的效用能量。</p><p>(c) 求電水煲的最終能源效益。</p><p>已知：水的比熱容量 = 4200 J kg <sup>−1</sup> °C <sup>−1</sup></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 輸入的能量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 2200 × (4 × 60)</p><p>= 528 000 J</p><p>(b) 輸出的效用能量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{o}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 1.5 × 4200 × (100 − 25)</p><p>= 472 500 J</p><p>(c) 最終能源效益 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E_{o}}{E_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100%</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>472500</mn><mn>528000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{472 500}{528 000}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100%</p><p>= 89.5%</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>電水壺的有用能量是水所吸收的能量。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,324.7318951171875,557.6491,508.048095703125],"text":"例 題 1 電水煲的最終能源效益\r\n一個 2200 W 的電水煲加熱 1.5 kg 的水，水的初温度為 25 °C。水在\r\n4 分鐘後煮沸。\r\n(a) 求輸入電水煲的能量。\r\n(b) 求電水煲輸出的效用能量。\r\n(c) 求電水煲的最終能源效益。\r\n已知：水的比熱容量 = 4200 J kg − 1 °C − 1\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,508.048095703125,557.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 輸入的能量 Ei = Pt\r\n= 2200 × (4 × 60) \r\n= 528 000 J\r\n(b) 輸出的效用能量 Eo = mcΔT\r\n = 1.5 × 4200 × (100 − 25) \r\n = 472 500 J\r\n(c) 最終能源效益 = Eo\r\nEi\r\n× 100% \r\n = 472 500\r\n528 000\r\n× 100% \r\n = 89.5%\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"tips","box":[40,320.7318951171875,176.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"提提你\r\n電水煲的效用能量是被水吸\r\n收的能量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-2":{"id":"ex-E301-2","chapter":"E301","number":2,"title":"能源標籤","question":"<p>下圖顯示一部電視機的部分能源標籤。</p><p>(a) 估算電視機運作 1460 小時的電費。每 kW h 的電費為 $1.1。</p><p>(b) 估算電視機的輸入功率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/c284fda0b359722fa4e133d0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:399.7px\"></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 電費 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1 \\times  38 = </annotation></semantics></math></span>41.8</p><p>(b) 輸入功率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>38</mn><mn>1460</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{38}{1460}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.0260 kW = 26 W</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>根據標籤，假設電視機每年運作 1460 小時，它會消耗 38 kW h 能量。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,384.92789511718746,557.4491,639.5498962402344],"text":"例 題 2 能源標籤\r\n以下所示是電視機能源標籤的一部分。\r\n1460\r\n1460\r\n0.19\r\n38\r\n80\r\n電視機\r\nABC\r\n某某牌\r\nHK1234\r\nC080123 / 2008\r\nXYZ\r\n某某某\r\nEnergy Efficiency Index 能源效益指數\r\nDiagonal Screen Size (cm)\r\n屏幕對角尺寸(厘米)\r\nTelevision\r\n(a) 每 kW h 的電費是 $1.1。試估算電視機運作 1460 小時的電費。\r\n(b) 估算電視機的輸入功率。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,639.5498962402344,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 電費 = $1.1 × 38 = $41.8\r\n(b) 輸入功率 = E\r\nt\r\n = 38\r\n1460\r\n = 0.0260 kW = 26 W\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"tips","box":[40,380.92789511718746,176.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n根據電視機的能源標籤，假\r\n如電視機一年運作1460小\r\n時，便 會 消 耗38 kW h 的\r\n能量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-3":{"id":"ex-E301-3","chapter":"E301","number":3,"title":"微波爐的輸出能量","question":"<p>(a) 一部 800 W 的微波爐把 0.3 kg 的馬鈴薯從 4 °C 加熱到 50 °C，需要的時間是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span>，這過程中微波爐的最終能源效益為 55%。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>馬鈴薯的比熱容量為 3400 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(b) 保羅建議使用電磁爐加熱馬鈴薯，因為電磁爐的最終能源效益較高。他將馬鈴薯浸入一鍋水中，然後將鍋放在 800 W 的電磁爐上。不過，他發現用電磁爐加熱馬鈴薯所需的實際時間反而較長。為甚麼？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 所需能量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.3 × 3400 × (50 − 4) = 46 920 J</p><p>輸出的效用功率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{o}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × η<sub>e</sub> = 800 × 55% = 440 W</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>o</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{o}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>46920</mn><mn>440</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{46 920}{440}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 107 s P</p><p>(b) 把鍋和水加熱需要額外的能量。因為水的比熱容量很高，所需的額外能量很大。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>由 E = Pt，t = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p>這裏的 P 是能量傳遞至薯仔的速率，即有用輸出功率。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,143.07499511718743,562.6491,330.39068603515625],"text":"例 題 3 微波爐的輸出能量\r\n(a) 一部 800 W 的微波爐把 0.3 kg 的馬鈴薯從 4 °C 加熱到 50 °C，\r\n需要的時間是 t，這過程中微波爐的最終能源效益為 55%。求 t。\r\n馬鈴薯的比熱容量為 3400 J kg–1 °C–1。\r\n(b) 保羅建議使用電磁爐加熱馬鈴薯，因為電磁爐的最終能源效益較\r\n高。他將馬鈴薯浸入一鍋水中，然後將鍋放在 800 W 的電磁爐\r\n上。不過，他發現用電磁爐加熱馬鈴薯所需的實際時間反而較\r\n長。為甚麼？\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,330.39068603515625,562.6491,493.9279951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 所需能量 E = mcΔT = 0.3 × 3400 × (50 − 4) = 46 920 J\r\n輸出的效用功率 Po = Pi × η e = 800 × 55% = 440 W\r\nt = E\r\nP o\r\n = 46 920\r\n440\r\n = 107 s\r\n(b) 把鍋和水加熱需要額外的能量。因為水的比熱容量很高，所需的\r\n額外能量很大。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"tips","box":[40,139.07499511718743,181.6491,493.9279951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n根據 E = Pt，t = E\r\nP\r\n這裏的 P 是微波爐至馬鈴\r\n薯的能量傳遞率，即微波爐\r\n輸出的效用功率。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-4":{"id":"ex-E301-4","chapter":"E301","number":4,"title":"運作成本","question":"<p>廸詩用最終能源效益為 72% 的電熱平板爐煮食，她每天煮食所需的平均能量是 5.4 MJ。計算廸詩每天使用這電熱平板爐煮食所需的電費。每 kW h 電能的費用是 $1.1。</p>","answer":"<p>輸入能量 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>o</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>η</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>%</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 7.5 × 10<sup>6</sup> J</p><p>電費 = $1.1 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = $2.29</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>記得把 J 轉換為 kW h。</p><p>1 kW h = 1000 W × 3600 s</p><p>= (1000 × 3600) J</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,511.77189511718746,562.4491,629.0883941650391],"text":"例 題 4 運作成本\r\n廸詩用最終能源效益為 72% 的電熱平板爐煮食，她每天煮食所需的\r\n平均能量是 5.4 MJ。計算廸詩每天使用這電熱平板爐煮食所需的電\r\n費。每 kW h 電能的費用是 $1.1。\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,629.0883941650391,562.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n輸入能量 Ei = Eo\r\nη e\r\n = 5.4 × 106\r\n72%\r\n = 7.5 × 106\r\n J\r\n電費 = $1.1 × 7.5 × 106\r\n1000 × 3600\r\n = $2.29\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"tips","box":[40,507.77189511718746,181.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n記得要把 J 轉換為 kW h。\r\n1 kW h = 1000 W × 3600 s\r\n= (1000 × 3600) J\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-5":{"id":"ex-E301-5","chapter":"E301","number":5,"title":"冷卻能力","question":"<p>房間的大小為 3 m × 3 m × 2.5 m，內裏甚麼家具都沒有，只安裝了一部空調機。空調機的冷卻能力為 1.2 kW，開動了 3 分鐘。空氣的密度為 1.2 kg m<sup>–3</sup>，比熱容量為 1000 J kg<sup>–1</sup> °C<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 空調機從房間抽走了多少熱量？</p><p>(b) 估算房間內空氣的温度降低了多少。</p><p>(c) 實際上，房間內的温度降幅小於 (b) 的估算，試舉出一個原因。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 抽走的熱量</p><p>= 冷卻能力 × 時間</p><p>= 1200 × (3 × 60) = 2.16 × 10<sup>5</sup> J</p><p>(b) 房間內空氣的質量</p><p>= 1.2 × (3 × 3 × 2.5) = 27 kg</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mc</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{mc}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.16</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.16 \\times  10^{5}}{27 \\times  1000}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 8 °C</p><p>空氣的温度降低了 8 °C。</p><p>(c) 熱可能經牆壁從室外傳遞到房間內。／空調機須從牆壁抽走熱。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>質量 = 密度 × 體積</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,287.7318951171875,562.6491,471.048095703125],"text":"例 題 5 冷卻能力\r\n房間的大小為 3 m × 3 m × 2.5 m，內裏甚麼家具都沒有，只安裝了\r\n一部空調機。空調機的冷卻能力為 1.2 kW，開動了 3 分鐘。空氣的密\r\n度為 1.2 kg m–3，比熱容量為 1000 J kg–1 °C–1。\r\n(a) 空調機從房間抽走了多少熱量？\r\n(b) 估算房間內空氣的温度降低了多少。\r\n(c) 實際上，房間內的温度降幅小於 (b) 的估算，試舉出一個原因。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,471.048095703125,562.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 抽走的熱量\r\n = 冷卻能力 × 時間\r\n = 1200 × (3 × 60) = 2.16 × 105\r\n J\r\n(b) 房間內空氣的質量\r\n = 1.2 × (3 × 3 × 2.5) = 27 kg\r\n根據 Q = mcΔT，\r\nΔT = Q\r\nmc = 2.16 × 105\r\n27 × 1000\r\n = 8 °C\r\n空氣的温度降低了 8 °C。\r\n(c) 熱可能經牆壁從室外傳遞到房間內。／空調機須從牆壁抽走熱。\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"tips","box":[40,283.7318951171875,181.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"除特別指明外，本書假設空\r\n調機的運作功率與冷卻能力\r\n相同。\r\n提提你\r\n質量 = 密度 × 體積\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-6":{"id":"ex-E301-6","chapter":"E301","number":6,"title":"性能係數","question":"<p>空調機的功率是 1500 W，性能係數是 2.3。</p><p>(a) 求空調機在 1 分鐘內可從房間抽走的熱量。</p><p>(b) 求空調機釋放至室外的熱排放率。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 冷卻能力 = 輸入的電功率 × 性能係數</p><p>= 1500 × 2.3</p><p>= 3450 W</p><p>抽走的熱量 = 冷卻能力 × 時間</p><p>= 3450 × 60</p><p>= 2.07 × 10<sup>5</sup> J</p><p>(b) 釋放至室外的熱排放率</p><p>= 冷卻能力 + 輸入的電功率 = 3450 + 1500 = 4950 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":29,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,396.7318951171875,562.6491,526.048095703125],"text":"例 題 6 性能係數\r\n空調機的功率是 1500 W，性能係數是 2.3。\r\n(a) 求空調機在 1 分鐘內可從房間抽走的熱量。\r\n(b) 求空調機釋放至室外的熱排放率。\r\n"},{"page":29,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,526.048095703125,562.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 冷卻能力 = 輸入的電功率 × 性能係數\r\n = 1500 × 2.3\r\n = 3450 W\r\n抽走的熱量 = 冷卻能力 × 時間\r\n = 3450 × 60\r\n = 2.07 × 105\r\n J\r\n(b) 釋放至室外的熱排放率\r\n = 冷卻能力 + 輸入的電功率 = 3450 + 1500 = 4950 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E301-7":{"id":"ex-E301-7","chapter":"E301","number":7,"title":"空調機的能源標籤","question":"<p>以下是一部空調機的能源標籤。</p><p>ABC 某某牌HK1234 C080123 / 2008 XYZ 如果這部空調機今年共操作 1200 小時，而總耗電量<sub>某某</sub>為<sub>某</sub>2074 kW h，求空調機的性能係數。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/6ad734ddccb3555e3c14d9fb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:502.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2074</mn><mn>1200</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2074}{1200}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.73 kW</p><p>性能係數 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>冷卻能力</mtext><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{冷卻能力}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5.12</mn><mn>1.73</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5.12}{1.73}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 2.96</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E301_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"4a381acc39dd98fae171f071bba875d2458aecdf2d87df85dc569cd6ad6b76b3","segments":[{"page":30,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,291.5574951171875],"text":"例 題 7 空調機的能源標籤\r\n以下是一部空調機的能源標籤。\r\nR410A\r\n5.12\r\nABC\r\n某某牌\r\nHK1234\r\nC080123 / 2008\r\nXYZ 如果這部空調機今年共操作 1200 小時，而總耗電量為某某某2074 kW h，\r\n求空調機的性能係數。\r\n"},{"page":30,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,291.5574951171875,557.4491,463.0948951171875],"text":"題解\r\nP = E\r\nt\r\n = 2074\r\n1200\r\n = 1.73 kW\r\n性能係數 = 冷卻能力\r\nP\r\n = 5.12\r\n1.73\r\n = 2.96\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}